## Summary
The Russian military announced a successful strike on a Ukrainian cruise missile launch site in Kharkov Region, specifically targeting FP-5 Flamingo missiles. The event was reported by the Russian Ministry of Defense and includes video evidence.

## Key Points
- Russia conducted a military strike on a Ukrainian missile launch site
- The target was a launch site for FP-5 Flamingo cruise missiles
- The strike occurred in Kharkov Region, Ukraine
- The incident was reported by the Russian Ministry of Defense
- Video footage of the strike is available


